  <Document>
    <name>Cleveland Food System Map</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The goal of this map is to connect and create a stronger sense of community. Knowing is a part of the battle.<br><br>If there are any active or in-progress community gardens, farms, or markets that you would like to add, please submit them here: https://forms.gle/kQLemt4iT8gA5vmWA<br><br>If you are interested in volunteering, please fill out this form out for you or your organization: https://forms.gle/HEtXND9L3uKUJ5jZ7<br><br>Link to Cleveland Farmers’ Markets, Farm Stands, & Fresh Stops: https://www.notion.so/2068944e923b8028a176d0f7ea9d2b33?v=2068944e923b804e91b3000cde0988f2<br><br>CDPH One Stop Shop for Anything Food Systems Related:<br>https://www.clevelandohio.gov/city-hall/departments/public-health/programs-services/food-systems<br><br>If you are interested in getting involved, have resources to share, or have funding opportunities, please reach out to <br>Ridwan Lawal, Food Systems Coordinator with FARE <br>ridwan@thefareproject.org<br>(216)352-3706<br><br>For more information on all things Cleveland Agriculture, please reach out to<br>Zainab Pixler, Local Food Systems Strategies Coordinator<br>ZPixler@ClevelandOhio.gov<br>(216) 664-6175<br><br>**This map is in constant edit. Check regularly, as information might change.**]]></description>
